WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:08.860
Tuesday this week, on the west side of Chicago, 83rd and 4th graders from the Polaris Charter Academy gathered in the school gymnasium before heading out on a camping trip.
本周二，在芝加哥西区，来自极星特许学校的83年级和4th年级学生们在学校体育馆集合，准备去参加露营旅行。

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:13.640
This school does a lot of field trips, but this is the one the kids talk about all year.
这所学校组织了很多实地考察，但这是孩子们整整一年都在谈论的一次。

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.880
That's teacher Jenny Syme.
那是老师珍妮·赛姆。

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.540
