00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.460
I have issues today.
我今天有点状况。

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:26.300
If it's okay for issues to happen, that happens to me too.
如果出状况是正常的，那我也遇到过。

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:27.300
Okay.
好吧。

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.400
Take that, Neil Patrick Harris and the Tony telecast.
接招吧，尼尔·帕特里克·哈里斯和托尼奖颁奖典礼。

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:42.280
The trip was a resounding success, despite early fears of bears, bugs, and issues.
尽管一开始担心熊、虫子和各种状况，但这次旅行取得了巨大的成功。

