00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.540
They held a meeting this week at City Hall in Berwick, Pennsylvania.
本周他们在宾夕法尼亚州贝里克市市政厅举行了一场会议。

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.320
That is a town that has seen so much methamphetamine recently that people call it Methylvania.
那是一个近年来饱受冰毒泛滥之苦的小镇，以至于人们称之为“甲基芬尼亚”（Methylvania）。

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.200
First of all, thank you, everyone, for coming tonight.
首先，谢谢大家今晚的光临。

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:14.300
Detective Greg Martin told the crowd what they came to find out at this meeting, which is how can you tell if someone near you, a neighbor, a relative, somebody you see, is cooking meth?
侦探格雷格·马丁向人群讲述了他们来这里想要寻找的答案，那就是：如何辨别你身边的人——邻居、亲戚、你见过的某个人——是否在制毒？

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.160
And, of course, they have a PowerPoint for this.
当然，他们为此准备了一个幻灯片演示。

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.920
The telltale ingredients are Coleman Camp Fuel, lithium batteries, coffee filters, tinfoil spoons.
显眼的原料有科尔曼野营燃料、锂电池、咖啡滤纸、锡纸勺。

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:23.920
The main ingredient, of course, Sudafed, and one more.
当然，主要原料是苏打菲（Sudafed），还有一个。

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.780
What you folks can look for is you may not see all those chemicals because you're not in everybody's house.
大家可以注意的一点是，你可能看不到所有这些化学品，因为你不会去每个人的家里。

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:33.740
However, you may be in a retail store where there's a 13-year -old kid in there buying a large quantity of ice packs.
不过，你可能会去一家零售店，里面有一个13岁的小孩在买大量的冰袋。

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.160
Why would a kid need to buy ice packs?
一个小孩为什么需要买冰袋？

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:42.880
Elsewhere, Saturday, this past weekend, a kid who I will just call Jorge made a very literal jump from childhood to adulthood.
在别处，上周六，我姑且称之为豪尔赫的一个孩子，非常切实地从童年跨入了成年。

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:47.960
He was in juvenile detention in Central California, and on Saturday he turned 18 years old.
他在加州中部的一个未成年人拘留所里，周六他年满18岁了。

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:59.540
And so the night before, his last night as a 17-year-old, he was told that he couldn't sleep in his usual cell because after midnight he would officially be 18, he would be a legal adult, which means that he could not be with minors anymore.
所以在前一天晚上，也就是他作为17岁少年的最后一晚，他被告知不能睡在平时的牢房里，因为过了午夜他将正式满18岁，成为一名法律上的成年人，这意味着他不能再和未成年人待在一起了。

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.880
So the state moved him to a room in an isolated wing away from the other teenagers.
于是州里把他转移到隔离区的一个房间里，远离其他青少年。

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:11.500
and then the next morning he was shackled and handcuffed and got into the back of a transport van to be taken to an adult facility.
然后第二天早上，他被戴上手铐脚镣，坐进一辆运兵车的后部，被带往成人设施。

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.760
It'll be the county jail for about a week and then San Quentin.
将在县监狱呆大约一周，然后去圣昆廷。

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.860
Before the van pulled out, a staff nurse saw it, flagged it down, opened the door.
在面包车驶离之前，一名值班护士看到了，拦下它，打开了车门。

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:25.340
Boo-boo.
宝贝。

