Did you get something good to eat this morning?
今天早上吃到好吃的了吗？

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:40.720
No.
没有。

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:41.260
No?
没有？

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:41.640
No.
没有。

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:42.100
Oh well.
噢，好吧。

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:42.700
Yeah.
对。

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.200
Alright then.
那就这样吧。

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.160
Happy New Kisses, we love you.
新年飞吻，我们爱你。

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:44.760
Alright, me too.
好吧，我也是。

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:45.020
Alright.
好的。

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:45.740
Bye guys.
再见，伙计们。

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:46.100
Bye.
再见。

